        "runId": "ada-en-20261109-f7d28995258f43d8b02d73d0103556dd",
        "model": "GPT-6.1"
      },
      "text": "On this day, you’ll take one of two boat excursions. The island will be confirmed after booking.\n\n**Option 1. North Seymour and Bachas Beaches**\n\nYou are scheduled to return to Puerto Ayora at around 16:30. The rest of the day is free.\n\n**Option 2. South Plaza and Punta Carrión**\n\nAfter the walk, the yacht continues to Punta Carrión. Lunch is served on board. There is time to snorkel and swim at the point, where you may see rays, sharks and a variety of tropical fish.\n\nYou then return to your hotel.\n\n**Accommodation:** Villa Laguna 4*.  \n**Meals:** breakfast and lunch."
    },
